      "prompt": "A driver guarantees $V_{OL}\\le0.4$ V and $V_{OH}\\ge2.4$ V. The receiver accepts low through 0.8 V and high from 2.0 V. Find both margins.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "explanation": "Low-level noise may raise the low output toward the receiver threshold.",
          "latex": "NM_L=0.8-0.4=0.4\\ \\mathrm V"
        },
        {
          "explanation": "High-level noise may lower the high output toward its threshold.",
          "latex": "NM_H=2.4-2.0=0.4\\ \\mathrm V"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Noise margin",
      "type": "worked_example"
