      "id": "79afd91d-0bf5-422e-93a5-cbf0433f264f",
      "text": "The supplied implementation lecture develops transistor networks; its outline also names the chip families and delay topics below. PS2 supplies the PLA/LUT design tasks. The following descriptions connect those topics, without assuming an additional supplied lecture.",
